  "description": "Use the present tense of ići (to go) to talk about destinations.",
  "grammar_note": "The present-tense forms used here are: ja idem (I go/am going), ti ideš (you go), on/ona ide (he/she goes), and mi idemo (we go). Use u with many destinations: idem u grad (I’m going to town), ideš u školu (you’re going to school).",
